WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.130
Today the words come in a path. Each word is the one before, with one letter changed.

2
00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:12.393
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:12.893 --> 00:00:15.472
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:18.951 --> 00:00:19.913
The word is sat.

5
00:00:23.647 --> 00:00:24.642
The word is sit.

6
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.417
The word is sip.

7
00:00:30.317 --> 00:00:36.044
The change can be at the start, in the middle, or at the end. So every letter has to be looked at.

8
00:00:36.494 --> 00:00:39.784
Read the path together once, with a finger under each letter.

9
00:00:40.234 --> 00:00:44.185
If a guess comes, say the five words. Look again. Touch every letter.

10
00:00:44.635 --> 00:00:49.490
Job two is for your child alone. Four words that all start with the same letter.

11
00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:57.367
Your child reads each word, then draws a line to its picture. The first letter cannot help here. The other two decide.

12
00:00:57.817 --> 00:01:00.329
At the end, your child reads three words to you.
